<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<style>
  html { background: #ffffff; }
  body {
    width: 720pt; height: 405pt; margin: 0; padding: 0;
    background: #FFFFFF; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  }
  .header {
    background: #2C3E50; padding: 20pt 40pt;
    height: 40pt; display: flex; align-items: center;
  }
  h1 { color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 28pt; margin: 0; }
  .content { padding: 20pt 40pt; }

  .section { margin-bottom: 15pt; }
  .section-title {
    background: #F4F6F6; border-bottom: 2pt solid #F1C40F; margin-bottom: 5pt; padding: 5pt;
  }
  .section-title p {
    font-size: 18pt; color: #1C2833; font-weight: bold; margin: 0;
  }
  p, li { font-size: 14pt; color: #555; line-height: 1.3; margin: 3pt 0; }
  ul { margin-top: 3pt; padding-left: 15pt; }

  .grid { display: flex; gap: 15pt; }
  .col { flex: 1; background: #F4F6F6; padding: 10pt; border-radius: 5pt; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <h1>第二篇：投资实战与操作指南</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="content">
    <div class="section">
      <div class="section-title"><p>投资哲学</p></div>
      <p>少输比多赢更重要。建立概率思维，追求长期稳健的收益。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="col">
        <div class="section-title"><p>资产配置</p></div>
        <p><strong>美林时钟 (Merrill Lynch Clock)</strong></p>
        <p>指导大类资产配置，顺应经济周期轮动。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col">
        <div class="section-title"><p>股票投资基础</p></div>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>价值投资：</strong> 寻找被低估的优质资产。</li>
          <li><strong>分析方法：</strong> 掌握基本面指标 (PE, PB) 与 K 线图基础。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>